=== ADJUDICATION VERDICT (pooled hard subset): mixed ===
Within-model paired changes are heterogeneous across seeds. Neither a robust training-dynamics erosion story nor a pure static-mismatch story is fully supported.
Round 1 found KB gene-drug variance was about 64% within-encoder seed noise and 36% between encoders, so between-model comparisons had limited power. Within-seed paired changes across training remove between-seed noise and are the appropriate design for detecting a training-dynamics effect.

